  "observations": [
    "Inspected all 39 exact-r002 original PNGs in the candidate render manifest: 24 azimuths and 15 diagnostic views. All image/config hashes independently verified. This is actual frame inspection, not contact-sheet-only approval.",
    "Compared original baseline and revision under matching camera, frame plan, lighting and color management. Original hero/front/left/clay and new sideclay/supportdetail/undercut images were opened from the r002 paired baseline. Earlier r001 baseline full orbit and diagnostics were also inspected; they are historical context only.",
    "Unequal supports, the higher broken shoulder, sloping crest and local recesses give the crown and opening convincing asymmetric structure. Clay, reversehero, sideclay, undercut and orbit side views show actual thickness rather than a front-only decorated silhouette.",
    "r001 FAIL was specific: paired ruler-like front ledges/slit termination and circumferential plinth grooves. r002 clears those defects; remaining bedding transitions are broad quiet planes with localized recession. No new holes, detached support, collapsing underside or distracting surface ornament appeared across the required views.",
    "Cost is purpose-appropriate: 898 triangles, 1,752 exported POSITION vertices, 3 materials, 4 primitives and 51,388 bytes for a roughly 5.26 x 3.59 x 2.11 m focal prop. The geometry earns visible support/shoulder/thickness changes at normal and close views; it does not merely consume the generous brief ceiling."
  ],
